    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "How much do bathroom fitters in Liverpool cost?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "A full bathroom installation in Liverpool supply and fit starts from £7,000 for a design-led mid-range specification. Labour-only is from £2,500. En suite supply and fit from £4,500. Wet room supply and fit from £8,500. Shower enclosure supply and fit from £400. We provide a free written fixed-price quote after a design consultation that includes a Pinterest mood board, material samples and a full specification." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "How long does a bathroom installation in Liverpool take?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "A standard full bathroom renovation takes 7 to 10 days. An en suite takes 5 to 7 days. A wet room takes 7 to 10 days due to tanking and waterproofing. A single shower installation takes 1 to 2 days. Premium specifications with bespoke tiling or microcement finishes may take longer. We confirm the exact timeline at the design consultation and work to a fixed schedule." } },
